 "findings": [
  "FOUNDER-TURN HOLE (C2 CONFIRMED): the turn damage is protocol-invariant — paired damage delta v3-v3.1 = 0.000011 ± 0.000101 (SE within 1 SE); x1's provenance tag stays clean (frac 1), echo-score 0 ~ 0, admission never applies to founders (D1). v3.1 has NO lever for a trusted voice that turns: NEXT PROTOCOL SEED = founder-velocity guard (change-point detection on an entrenched voice's reward trajectory, demote on sustained |E[r] drop| rather than weight ratio).",
  "DEMOTION HALF-LIFE (C1 CONFIRMED): post-turn, trust crosses the 0.5x-median bar at round 252 (median lag 102 after the turn; 4/8 seeds never cross) and NEVER crosses the 0.25x bar (8/8) — the fixed-share floor (share=0.02) reflates x1 as fast as the reward gap erodes it. w-ratio curve (mean): {\"0\":1,\"50\":3.507428,\"100\":3.457761,\"149\":1.91075,\"155\":1.785859,\"170\":1.328817,\"200\":0.969281,\"250\":0.866301,\"300\":0.941216,\"399\":1.18323}.",
