  "E24 COMPARISON (C4 CONFIRMED): E24's from-genesis liar never reached the 0.25x bar (8/8, receipted); E27's turned founder — despite a 2.4x harsher post-turn penalty (reward 0.375 vs 0.624, generator confound receipted) — ALSO never reaches it (8/8), and enters the turn holding 7.5896% of the vote (E24's x1: 3.3%) vs median honest weight ratio 1.91075. Entrenchment at the turn is governed by acuity-drift rerolls: per-seed share at turn ranged 0.021654-0.135657.",
